ocs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#介绍","content":"我们的目标是使代码示例能够准确地用于Go的两个发布版本 releases."},"195":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-172","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#介绍","content":"所有代码都应该通过`golint`和`go vet`的检查并无错误。我们建议您将编辑器设置为："},"196":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-173","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#介绍","content":"保存时运行 `goimports`"},"197":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-174","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#介绍","content":"运行 `golint` 和 `go vet` 检查错误"},"198":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-175","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#介绍","content":"您可以在 Go 编辑器工具支持页面 中找到更为详细的信息。"},"199":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-176","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#指向-interface-的指针","content":"您几乎不需要指向接口类型的指针。您应该将接口作为值进行传递，在这样的传递过程中，实质上传递的底层数据仍然可以是指针。"},"200":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-177","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#指向-interface-的指针","content":"接口实质上在底层用两个字段表示："},"201":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-178","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#指向-interface-的指针","content":"一个指向某些特定类型信息的指针。您可以将其视为\"type\"。"},"202":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-179","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#指向-interface-的指针","content":"数据指针。如果存储的数据是指针，则直接存储。如果存储的数据是一个值，则存储指向该值的指针。"},"203":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-180","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#指向-interface-的指针","content":"如果希望接口方法修改基础数据，则必须使用指针传递 (将对象指针赋值给接口变量)。"},"204":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-181","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#指向-interface-的指针","content":"永远不要使用指向interface的指针，这个是没有意义的.在go语言中，接口本身就是引用类型，换句话说，接口类型本身就是一个指针。对于我的需求，其实test的参数只要是myinterface就可以了，只需要在传值的时候，传*mystruct类型（也只能传*mystruct类型）"},"205":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-182","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#interface-合理性验证","content":"在编译时验证接口的符合性。这包括："},"206":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-183","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#interface-合理性验证","content":"将实现特定接口的导出类型作为接口 API 的一部分进行检查"},"207":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-184","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#interface-合理性验证","content":"实现同一接口的 (导出和非导出) 类型属于实现类型的集合"},"208":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-185","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#interface-合理性验证","content":"任何违反接口合理性检查的场景，都会终止编译，并通知给用户"},"209":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-186","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#interface-合理性验证","content":"补充：上面 3 条是编译器对接口的检查机制，\n大体意思是错误使用接口会在编译期报错。\n所以可以利用这个机制让部分问题在编译期暴露。"},"210":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-187","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#interface-合理性验证","content":"如果 `*Handler` 与 `http.Handler` 的接口不匹配，\n那么语句 `var _ http.Handler = (*Handler)(nil)` 将无法编译通过。"},"211":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-188","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#interface-合理性验证","content":"赋值的右边应该是断言类型的零值。\n对于指针类型（如 `*Handler`）、切片和映射，这是 `nil`；\n对于结构类型，这是空结构。"},"212":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-189","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#接收器-receiver-与接口","content":"使用值接收器的方法既可以通过值调用，也可以通过指针调用。"},"213":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-190","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#接收器-receiver-与接口","content":"带指针接收器的方法只能通过指针或 [addressable values] 调用。"},"214":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-191","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#接收器-receiver-与接口","content":"例如，"},"215":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-192","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#接收器-receiver-与接口","content":"类似的，即使方法有了值接收器，也同样可以用指针接收器来满足接口。"},"216":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-193","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#接收器-receiver-与接口","content":"Effective Go 中有一段关于 pointers vs. values 的精彩讲解。"},"217":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-194","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#接收器-receiver-与接口","content":"补充："},"218":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-195","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#接收器-receiver-与接口","content":"一个类型可以有值接收器方法集和指针接收器方法集"},"219":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-196","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#接收器-receiver-与接口","content":"值接收器方法集是指针接收器方法集的子集，反之不是"},"220":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-197","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#接收器-receiver-与接口","content":"规则"},"221":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-198","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#接收器-receiver-与接口","content":"值对象只可以使用值接收器方法集"},"222":{"id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide-199","page_id":"/docs/backend/golang-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/golang-guide#接收器-receiver-与接口","content":"指针对象可以使用 值接收器方法集 + 指针接收器方法集"},"223":{"id":"/docs/backend/