"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-16","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"这张截图适合放在管理员培训中说明审计日志的读法。左侧筛选条件用于缩小范围，列表字段用于确认事实，操作详情用于补充上下文。实际排查时不能只截一张列表图，应同时记录筛选条件、关键日志行和处理结论，避免后续复盘时无法还原。"},"2343":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-17","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"常见筛选方式："},"2344":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-18","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"筛选维度"},"2345":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-19","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"适用场景"},"2346":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-20","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"操作人"},"2347":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-21","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"查询某个用户的登录、编辑、删除记录"},"2348":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-22","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"操作时间"},"2349":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-23","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"定位某个故障发生前后的变更"},"2350":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-24","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"操作类型"},"2351":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-25","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit#审计日志","content":"查询登录、创建、编辑、删除、导出等动作"},"2352":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit-26","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/audit","tags":[],"type":"text","url":