s#通知用户登录","content":"通知用户登录"},"2775":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-8","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#调整用户角色","content":"调整用户角色"},"2776":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-9","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#组织维护","content":"组织维护"},"2777":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-10","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#账号生命周期","content":"账号生命周期"},"2778":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-11","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#账号安全建议","content":"账号安全建议"},"2779":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-12","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#默认密码与重置密码","content":"默认密码与重置密码"},"2780":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-13","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"2781":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-14","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","content":"用户和组织是权限管理的基础。组织用于表达人员归属，用户用于登录和操作，角色用于授权。三者需要分开理解：组织不直接承载权限，角色才是权限的主要载体。"},"2782":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-15","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","content":"入口：系统管理 → 用户管理。"},"2783":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-16","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","content":"用户管理页是管理员处理账号生命周期的主入口。图中通常可以看到组织树、用户列表、搜索区和操作按钮。日常操作时，先在组织树定位部门，再在用户列表中搜索账号；新增、禁用、重置密码、调整角色都应从这里开始。"},"2784":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-17","page_id"