":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-147","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"检查聚合方式、关联关系和过滤条件"},"5845":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-148","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"行数"},"5846":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-149","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"是否符合预期范围"},"5847":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-150","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"加日期过滤、项目过滤或检查源表"},"5848":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-151","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"类型"},"5849":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-152","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"金额、数量、耗时是否识别为数值"},"5850":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-153","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"在 SQL 中做类型转换"},"5851":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-154","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"SQL 编写建议："},"5852":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-155","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"建议"},"5853":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-156","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"原因"},"5854":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-157","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"不使用 `select *`"},"5855":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-158","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"源表加字段后会影响数据集结构"},"5856":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-159","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"给字段起业务别名"},"5857":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-160","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"图表里直接显示业务名称，减少二次改名"},"5858":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-161","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"控制返回字段数量"},"5859":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-162","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"字段越少，图表配置越清晰"},"5860":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-163","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"把过滤条件写清楚"},"5861":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-164","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"例如只保留有效订单、排除测试数据"},"5862":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-165","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"避免在报表层写复杂业务逻辑"},"5863":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-166","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"复杂口径应进入数仓视图或公共 SQL"},"5864":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-167","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"保存前运行预览"},"5865":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-168","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"防止 SQL 成功保存但字段不可用"},"5866":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-169","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#保存为数据集","content":"如果 SQL 涉及参数、系统变量或动态条件，要在预览中测试不同值，不能只测试默认值。"},"5867":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-170","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"当一张表无法满足分析需求时，可以把事实表和维表组合成一个数据集。例如订单明细关联门店表、项目明细关联客户表。"},"5868":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-171","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"多表建模仍然在表模式编辑器中完成。常见做法是先拖入事实表，再拖入维表，最后配置关联字段和关联方式。下面以“订单明细 + 门店维表”为例说明：订单明细负责金额和数量，门店维表负责区域、城市、门店等级等属性。"},"5869":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-172","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"截图左上角的“单源/跨源”用于决定数据集是否可以选择多个数据源。单源适合大多数场景，性能和维护成本更可控；跨源适合多个系统之间做轻量关联。跨源建模前，先确认两个数据源的刷新时间、字段口径和数据量都能接受。"},"5870":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-173","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"跨源并不是“能关联就应该关联”。如果数据量大、刷新频率高，建议先在数仓或数据库中加工成统一视图；如果只是把少量目标值、映射表或字典表补到主数据里，跨源会比较合适。"},"5871":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-174","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"配置前先确认："},"5872":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-175","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"项目"},"5873":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-176","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#多表和跨源建模","content":"要确认什么"},"5874":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-177","page_id":"/d