清楚","content":"右侧或底部：风险、告警、明细表。"},"7143":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-140","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#创建前先想清楚","content":"最底部：指标口径、数据来源或刷新频率。"},"7144":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-141","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#从零创建大屏","content":"在数据大屏列表点击“新建”后，会进入空白设计器。新建页面默认只有画布、图层区和右侧大屏配置。"},"7145":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-142","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#从零创建大屏","content":"空白画布截图展示了新建后的初始状态。左侧通常是图层和资源区域，中间是画布，右侧是大屏配置。第一步先设置画布尺寸、背景、配色和名称，再添加图表。"},"7146":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-143","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#设置名称和目录","content":"名称要写清用途，例如“经营驾驶舱”“研发经营总览”“项目交付监控”。不建议使用“测试大屏”“新建大屏 1”这类名称。正式项目建议放进对应业务文件夹。"},"7147":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-144","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#设置画布尺寸","content":"先在右侧“大屏配置”里设置宽高。普通 16:9 屏建议 `1920 × 1080`。如果目标是 4K 屏，可以用 `3840 × 2160`。拼接屏按实际比例设置，不能直接套用 16:9。"},"7148":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-145","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#设置背景和配色","content":"先选背景色，再选配色方案。背景建议用深色或浅色中的一种，避免混用过多色块。配色方案确定后，指标卡、折线、柱形、标签尽量沿用同一套颜色。"},"7149":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-146","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#保存一次","content":"空白画布设置好后先保存。后续预览、发布、外部参数和跳转都依赖已保存的大屏资源。"},"7150":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-147","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#保存一次","content":"右侧配置区中的“尺寸、基础配置、背景、配色”是创建大屏的基础。常见问题是组件完成后才发现画布比例不合适。比例一旦改动，组件位置和字号通常都要重新调整。"},"7151":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-148","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"高质量大屏依赖稳定的页面结构，而不是单个组件的视觉效果。建议先按区域放置组件，再逐个绑定数据。"},"7152":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-149","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"标题、说明、更新时间和指标口径通常用文本组件完成。创建骨架时，可以先添加一个富文本作为标题，再复制几个文本组件作为区块标题。这样页面结构会先稳定下来，后续添加图表时更容易保持层级一致。"},"7153":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-150","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"一个常见的示例结构："},"7154":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-151","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"区域"},"7155":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-152","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"内容"},"7156":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-153","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"创建方式"},"7157":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-154","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"标题区"},"7158":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-155","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"大屏标题、业务说明、更新时间"},"7159":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-156","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"使用文本组件"},"7160":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-157","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"指标区"},"7161":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-158","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/sc