"},"7225":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-222","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第三步绑定数据","content":"阶段字段要按业务顺序排列"},"7226":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-223","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第三步绑定数据","content":"如果图表没有数据，先清空筛选，再回到数据集预览。确认数据正常后再调整样式。"},"7227":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-224","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第三步绑定数据","content":"绑定数据时建议每做完一个组件就保存一次。大屏组件较多，等全部组件都完成后再保存，一旦浏览器刷新或网络异常，可能丢失较多配置。"},"7228":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-225","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"v1.5.5 起，数据大屏支持“导出按钮”组件。它适合在大屏上放一个明确的下载入口，让用户按当前筛选条件导出某个表格视图。"},"7229":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-226","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"导出按钮通常和明细表或汇总表配合使用："},"7230":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-227","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"配置项"},"7231":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-228","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"说明"},"7232":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-229","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"按钮文案"},"7233":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-230","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"展示在大屏上的按钮文字，例如“导出明细”“下载当前筛选结果”"},"7234":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-231","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"目标表格"},"7235":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-232","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"选择当前大屏中的明细表、汇总表或透视表组件"},"7236":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-233","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"导出范围"},"7237":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-234","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"可选择当前筛选结果或全部数据"},"7238":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-235","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"透视表格式"},"7239":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-236","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"透视表可按配置导出带格式 Excel"},"7240":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-237","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置大屏导出按钮","content":"配置步骤："},"7241":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-238","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先配置表格","content":"先把明细表或汇总表放到画布中，完成数据集、字段、排序、表头说明和权限检查。"},"7242":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-239","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#添加导出按钮","content":"在组件面板中添加导出按钮，将按钮放在表格附近或页面操作区。"},"7243":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-240","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#绑定目标表格","content":"在按钮配置中选择要导出的表格组件。目标表格应是用户当前能看懂、能核对的数据。"},"7244":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-241","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#选择导出范围","content":"需要按页面查询组件、联动和外部参数导出时，选择当前筛选结果。需要导出完整数据时，确认权限和数据量后再选择全部数据。"},"7245":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-242","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览并验证","content":"发布前进入预览页，设置筛选条件后点击导出按钮，确认导出中心生成任务，下载后核对字段、表头和数据范围。"},"7246":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-243","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览并验证","content":"导出按钮不是简单截图下载。表格视图导出会结合当前筛选、联动、外部参数、Web 参数和钻取上下文生成 Excel。正式大屏中建议把导出按钮放在明细表附近，并用清晰文案说明导出范围。"},"7247":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-244","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#实战做出示例里的关键组件","content":"内置大屏里有几类组件适合复用：累积流图、阶段漏斗、投入产出矩阵、明细表、趋势图和时效排行。下面按“组件效果、示例字段、编辑器配置”说明。示例字段只用于演示配置思路，正式页面应替换为企业自己的需求、项目、人员、质量或经营字段。"},"7248":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-245","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"这张图用于看需求在不同阶段的堆积情况。面积越厚，说明该阶段积压越多；整体上升，说明需求池总量在增长；某个颜色持续变厚，通常代表该阶段成为瓶颈。"},"7249":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-246","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"演示示例配置："},"7250":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-247","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"配置项"},"7251":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-248","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"7252":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-249","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"图表类型"},"7253":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-250","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"累积流图"},"7254":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-251","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"数据集"},"7255":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-252","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"需求阶段每日快照类数据集"},"7256":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-253","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"X 轴"},"7257":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-254","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"日期 `stat_date`"},"7258":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-255","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"Y 轴"},"7259":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-256","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"需求数 `req_count`，汇总方式为求和"},"7260":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-257","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"堆叠/系列"},"7261":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-258","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"需求阶段 `stage_name`"},"7262":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-259","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"创建步骤："},"7263":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-260","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#准备数据集","content":"数据集至少要有日期、阶段、需求数三个字段。日期是一行快照的统计日期，阶段是需求当时所在阶段，需求数是该日期该阶段的数量。"},"7264":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-261","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#添加累积流图","content":"在大屏编辑器点击“图表”，选择累积流图。把组件放到页面主图区，宽度建议占页面一半以上，高度保持足够展示空间。"},"7265":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-262","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#绑定字段","content":"选择数据集后，把“日期”放入 X 轴，把“需求数”放入 Y 轴，把“需求阶段”放入系列或堆叠字段。"},"7266":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-263","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#设置排序","content":"阶段顺序建议按业务流转顺序排列，例如需求池、分析澄清、就绪待开发、开发中、代码评审、测试验证、待发布。"},"7267":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-264","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"打开平滑曲线和面积填充，保留图例。颜色按阶段固定，避免每次刷新后变化。X 轴日期可以按天或周展示，标签过密时减少显示。"},"7268":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-265","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"使用提醒：累积流图依赖“每日阶段快照”。如果只有当前状态，没有历史快照，就无法还原阶段变化，只能做当前阶段分布。"},"7269":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-266","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"可以按以下样例准备数据。字段名不必完全一样，但含义要对应："},"7270":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-267","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"统计日期"},"7271":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-268","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求阶段"},"7272":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-269","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求数"},"7273":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-270","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"2026-05-01"},"7274":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-271","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求池"},"7275":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-272","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"42"},"7276":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-273","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"2026-05-01"},"7277":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-274","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"开发中"},"7278":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-275","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"18"},"7279":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-276","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"2026-05-02"},"7280":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-277","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求池"},"7281":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-278","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"46"},"7282":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-279","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"2026-05-02"},"7283":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-280","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"开发中"},"7284":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-281","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"21"},"7285":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-282","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"如果数据源是一条需求一行，也可以先在 SQL 或数据集中按日期和阶段聚合成这种结构，再给大屏使用。"},"7286":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-283","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"这张图用于展示每个阶段的数量、平均耗时、P90 耗时和超期数量。它比普通漏斗更适合研发交付场景，因为用户能同时看到“量”和“耗时主要集中在哪些阶段”。"},"7287":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-284","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"演示示例配置："},"7288":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-285","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"配置项"},"7289":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-286","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"7290":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-287","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"图表类型"},"7291":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-288","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"阶段周期漏斗"},"7292":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-289","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"数据集"},"7293":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-290","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"阶段周期统计类数据集"},"7294":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-291","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"阶段字段"},"7295":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-292","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#阶段周期漏斗","content":"阶段 `stage_name`"},"7296":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-293","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text"