[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"使用提醒：漏斗的重点不是视觉宽度，而是清晰呈现阶段差异。阶段太多时，优先保留主流程阶段，把过细状态归并。"},"7307":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-304","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"阶段周期漏斗的字段可以从需求流转记录中计算出来。示例结构如下："},"7308":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-305","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"阶段"},"7309":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-306","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"需求数"},"7310":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-307","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"平均耗时"},"7311":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-308","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"P90 耗时"},"7312":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-309","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"超期数"},"7313":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-310","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"需求澄清"},"7314":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-311","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"36"},"7315":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-312","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"2.4"},"7316":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-313","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"5.0"},"7317":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-314","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","t