/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"系列"},"7402":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-399","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"可选部门 `department`"},"7403":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-400","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"创建时要注意：日期维度要能正确排序；如果展示月度趋势，建议统一成 `YYYY-MM`，不要混用中文月份和日期文本。"},"7404":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-401","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#吞吐量月度趋势","content":"如果要放到大屏主图区，趋势图建议只放 2 到 3 条线。线条过多时，观众难以远距离辨认。需要展示更多部门时，可以改成部门筛选或排行图。"},"7405":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-402","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"这张图用于比较各阶段平均耗时和 P90 耗时。P90 比平均值更能暴露长尾问题。"},"7406":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-403","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"配置方式："},"7407":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-404","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"配置项"},"7408":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-405","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"7409":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-406","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"图表类型"},"7410":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-407","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"横向条形图"},"7411":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-408","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"分类"},"7412":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-409","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"需求阶段 `stage_name`"},"7413":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-410","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"指标"},"7414":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-411","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"平均耗时 `avg_days`、P90 耗时 `p90_days`"},"7415":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-412","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"创建时建议把 P90 和平均值使用不同颜色。若阶段名称较长，横向条形图比竖向柱状图更容易阅读。"},"7416":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-413","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#分段时效-p90","content":"P90 的含义要在页面上说清楚。可以在图表标题或说明里写“P90 表示 90% 的需求在该天数内完成”。如果观众不熟悉统计指标，只写 P90 会影响理解。"},"7417":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-414","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"数据正确后，再做样式。大屏样式的目标是“远距离可读”，而非开启所有视觉效果。"},"7418":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-415","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"编辑器截图适合对照右侧样式面板。选中不同组件，右侧配置项会变化。调整样式时先统一标题、字号和单位，再处理颜色、边框、背景和动画。"},"7419":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-416","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"选中组件后，右侧会显示该组件的配置项。先调整位置、尺寸和层级，再调数据和样式。大屏制作中不要频繁手工拖出不同尺寸，建议同一行组件保持相同高度，相邻组件保持一致间距。"},"7420":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-417","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第四步调整样式","content":"样式调整顺序："},"7421":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen